From 456e9533a5ac356adf4637453f1fb3d5326240be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:19:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] falsify-regional-cue: the pre-registered test of an
 on-the-fly regional ant for the capital-letter cue: NEGATIVE

Prequential, leave-one-text-family-out on the independent gold: the ant (a regional offset on the cue, re-estimated after every verified outcome, shrunk toward the global rate)
gives AUC minus the shipped weights of -0.0011 clean, -0.0031 case noise, -0.0011 typos, 0.0000 lowercase (the cue is silent there), -0.0010 ALL [-0.0021, -0.0000].
Origin swap (weak labels as outcomes): -0.0006, not circular. Decision rule fixed in advance: negative result recorded; not built.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AP2eRC5CScKTs8ZE4Wpdoe
